  first | exact @GlobalTheory.LatticeSelfDual.selfDual_of_charDual | exact GlobalTheory.LatticeSelfDual.selfDual_of_charDual | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.LatticeSelfDual.selfDual_of_charDual <;> assumption)
